flowchart TD
  DA[Driver app<br/>location every 4 s] -- WebSocket --> LOC[Location service<br/>in-memory index per city]
  RA[Rider app] -- "request · track" --> DIS[Dispatch<br/>nearest → ETA rank → offer → claim]
  DIS --> LOC
  DIS --> TRIP[Trip service<br/>state machine · trips DB]
  TRIP --> PAY[Payments<br/>authorise → capture]
  LOC -. location stream .-> K{{Kafka}}
  K --> PRICE[Surge pricing · analytics]
